                            <comment id="16260606" author="zjffdu" created="Tue, 21 Nov 2017 11:37:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=prabhjyotsingh&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;prabhjyotsingh&quot;&gt;prabhjyotsingh&lt;/a&gt; This is because zeppelin will read all the notes for the note list in the home page for the first time. But zeppelin has to do this because note title in in the note file. Putting note name in note file is not a good design IMHO. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
